han 5 years and have not taken any paid study leave in that time, whereas I understand that others have done so.&nbsp;Kind regards,Anna &nbsp;​​​​Anna&nbsp;Moon(She/Her)Senior&nbsp;Associate+44&nbsp;(0)&nbsp;7890&nbsp;043&nbsp;618&nbsp;"}

