Dear Erika and Gregory,
&nbsp;
A very, very, very warm welcome to the NOx team - it is great to have you both!
&nbsp;&nbsp;
By&nbsp;way&nbsp;of&nbsp;introduction, I am a paralegal at Pogust Goodhead, currently working on the NOx Emissions litigation in the Mercedes, JLR, and Renault/Nissan proceedings. We will soon be requesting
 your addition to the Confidentiality ring (CRO) across all cases. The Defendants will have five working days to accept or refuse your addition as per paragraph 4.1.2&nbsp;of&nbsp;the sealed orders attached.
&nbsp;
I have attached all undertakings to be signed along with the relevant sealed order. For completeness, the CROs relate to (i) Mercedes (February and July Orders), (ii) Nissan, (iii) Renault,
 (iv) PCD, (v) Ford, and (vi) Pan-Lead.
&nbsp;
We would be grateful if you could add to the undertakings the following:
