&nbsp;
The Defendants have made it clear that should the parties be unable to reach an agreement, they will be seeking the Court make an order of indemnity costs against the Claimants
 at the PTR on Monday 6 October. The approach taken by so far has been to sound out the Defendants as to whether we can reach an agreement that avoids them making such an application. LD have sent a WP offer to Mercedes, &quot;offer[ing] either (i) 66% in relation
